OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome bright
OL,6,Fevening sunshine to end the day.
OL,7,FHowever, cloud will increase from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest later, with rain arriving
OL,9,Fduring the early hours. Another mild
OL,10,Fnight ahead.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA cloudy start, with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain already across the
OL,14,Fregion, sinking south during the
OL,15,Fmorning. Drier and brighter skies
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon, with the odd
OL,17,Fshower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
